index c421116..240d5e5 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.rst
+++ b/CHANGELOG.rst
@@ -1,3 +1,13 @@
+Unreleased
+==========
+* Fixed invariants of a subclass leaking into its base class and sibling classes (#295)
+
+  When a class neither inherited from ``icontract.DBC`` nor used
+  ``icontract.DBCMeta`` as its metaclass, the invariant decorator modified
+  the inherited ``__invariants__`` lists in place. This caused the invariants
+  of a derived class to be erroneously applied to its base class as well as
+  to its sibling classes.
+
 2.7.0
 =====
 * Allowed to enforce invariants on attribute setting (#292)
